    <string name="onboard_1_title">Mount the phone sideways</string>
    <string name="onboard_1_body">Clamp it to the wheelchair tray in landscape, about an arm\'s length away, with the screen facing the student.</string>
    <string name="onboard_2_title">Plug in the toy</string>
    <string name="onboard_2_body">Connect the switch box with the USB cable, then plug the toy into the jack. Without the box, the phone still plays songs and lights on its own.</string>
